abstract: >-
  End-to-end workflow to regrid ocean model data (RiOMar/GAMAR) from
  curvilinear grids to HEALPix (DGGS) format using xarray, Dask and Kerchunk,
  running both locally (HTTPS mode) and on HPC infrastructure. Part of the
  FAIR2Adapt initiative.
